### Register
POST http://localhost:3333/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "passwordConfirmation": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3333/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("token", response.body.token.value);
%}

### Refresh (requires login first)
POST http://localhost:3333/api/v1/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (requires login first)
POST http://localhost:3333/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###